$\Delta_N\le\min_j\|f_j\|^2$ up to the syzygy correction". $\Delta_N$ is a minimum over vectors
orthogonal to $\mathrm{Syz}(I)_N$; the test vector $w^{N-m_j}e_j$ is not in general orthogonal to

