  row sparsity `≤ Σ_j (#monomials of f_j)^2` and entries
  `Σ_j conj(f_{j,α}) f_{j,β} sqrt(k! (k-α+β)!)/(k-α)!`, reversibly computable in
  `poly(n, log N)` time.
